# Root-level ignore for `vercel deploy` run from the monorepo root.
# This repo's root deploys build apps/tolom only (project Root Directory =
# apps/tolom), so sibling apps' sources are excluded from uploads.
# Workspace members' package.json files are kept so `pnpm install` at the
# root can resolve every project in pnpm-lock.yaml.

# --- Heavy / generated (also gitignored, kept here for the tgz archive path) ---
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.turbo
**/logs
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*

# --- Sibling apps: keep only their package.json for workspace resolution ---
apps/*
!apps/tolom/
!apps/tolom/**
!apps/*/package.json
